  "description" : "Li Lan, the junior master of the Ten Thousand Immortals Sect, descends the mountain to find a fiery woman who causes him unbearable pain in order to overcome his tribulation of love. However, he gets caught up in the conflict between the Golden Coin Pavilion and the extraterrestrial demons. He and Jin Yuanbao go from bickering and sabotaging each other to sharing life and death, joining forces to thwart the Demon Emperor`s plot to descend upon the Canglan Realm. In the final battle, Jin Yuanbao sacrifices himself to protect him, his soul scattered. Li Lan is heartbroken, his tribulation of love is completed, he becomes a Taiyi Golden Immortal in one step, slays the Demon Emperor, and embarks on a new journey to ascend to the Heavenly Realm to find a secret treasure and rescue Jin Yuanbao.\nsource: movie.douban.com/googletranslate",
